#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho kukui 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho kukui 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "ʻAʻole hiki ke mālama i ke ʻano hoʻohālike maka"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "E nānā i ke kŘkohu lua"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "ʻAʻole hiki ke hoʻopaʻa i ke kumu hoʻohālike ʻelua"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ua mālama ʻia kāu kumu hoʻohālike mua, no laila ua hana ke komo alo. Pono e "
"ʻālohilohi ka lumi e ʻike ai i kou helehelena - e hoʻololi i ke kukui ma mua "
"o ka hoʻopau ʻana - a laila e hoʻāʻo hou, a i ʻole e lele a hoʻohui i kahi "
"kumu hoʻohālike ma hope mai nā Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Nānā ʻelua: makaaniani, ʻumiʻumi a i ʻole kukui ʻokoʻa"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Ua mālama ʻia ke kumu hoʻohālike mua: ke hana nei ka komo ʻana me ka maka. "
"Ke hoʻoikaika ke kumu hoʻohālike ʻelua i ka hilinaʻi o ka ʻike ʻana ke loli "
"kekahi mea: e komo i nā makaaniani āu e komo ai i kekahi manawa (a i ʻole e "
"wehe), e hoʻopaʻa me ka ʻumiʻumi ʻokoʻa, a e hoʻololi i ke kukui — e hoʻā a "
"i ʻole e hoʻopio i kekahi kukui, e neʻe aku mai ka puka aniani. E mālama i "
"kou maka i ʻike maopopo ʻia a e kaomi hou iā Nānā; e hahai ana ka hopu "
"pōkole alakaʻi like."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia "
"maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ke nānā nei i nā lako a me nā mea hana TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia "
"maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ua ʻike ʻia ka lako lako TPM. Ke kau 'akomi nei <i>tpm2-"
"tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia "
"maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Kūlana TPM:</b> Lako Paʻa TPM 2.0 hana. E hoʻopaʻa paʻa ʻia kāu ʻōlelo "
"huna i loko o ka TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia "
"maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Kulana TPM:</b> Ua ʻike ʻia ka lako lako TPM, akā ʻaʻole i hoʻokomo ʻia "
"ka <i>tpm2-tools</i>. Holo <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Ke "
"hāʻule hou nei i ka caching hōʻoiaʻiʻo ma muli o ka lako polokalamu."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻakomi i kāu {} me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia "
"maka (ʻike ʻia ka ʻeke: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Kulana TPM:</b> ʻAʻole i ʻike ʻia ka lako lako TPM. Ke hoʻohana nei i ka "
"hoʻopaʻa ʻana i ka hōʻoia ʻana i ka lako polokalamu (AES-256-GCM)."

