#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Nā kiʻi paʻi o kou helehelena i hoʻohālikelike ʻia e Ubuntu Hello. E mālama "
"ma lalo o ʻelua, i hoʻopaʻa ʻia i nā kukui ʻokoʻa."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Hōʻike i nā kumu hoʻohālike i mālama ʻia no:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Hoʻokahi wale nō kumu hoʻohālike maka i kākau inoa ʻia. Hoʻololi nā "
"makaaniani, ka loli o ka ʻumiʻumi a i ʻole ke kukui ʻokoʻa i ke ʻano o kou "
"maka i ke kāmera, no laila hiki i ke kumu hoʻohālike hoʻokahi ke hāʻule (e "
"like me ke ahiahi ma lalo o nā kukui). E hoʻohui i kekahi kumu hoʻohālike "
"ʻelua me nā makaaniani a i ʻole ʻaʻole, kou hiʻona ʻē aʻe, a i ʻole ma ke "
"kukui ʻokoʻa i mau ka hilinaʻi o ka wehe ʻana."

#: src/main.ui:146
