"ma kahi me ka hopena."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Kani hoʻolaha"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻokani i ke kani ʻōnaehana no kahi hoʻāʻo ʻike ʻia a ʻaʻole i hāʻule."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Hoʻokomo i nā diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻohui i ke kumu hoʻohālike, ʻoiaʻiʻo a me ka paepae, nā kiʻi paʻi kiʻi, "
"ka pahupaʻikiʻi a me ka manawa i kēlā me kēia kāleka. Pono i ka hōʻike ʻana "
"i kahi pilikia."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Palekana"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"ʻO ka pololei o ke kūlike ʻana o kou maka, a me ka noi ʻana paha a Ubuntu "
"Hello iā ʻoe e hōʻoia aia maoli ʻoe i mua o ke kāmera."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Ka paʻakikī o ke kūlike ʻana o ka maka"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "wikiwiki"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Kaulike"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Paʻa"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "E noi mai iaʻu e kūnou no ka hōʻoia"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Ma hope o ke kūlike ʻana o kou maka, e noi mai kekahi hoʻolaha iā ʻoe e "
"kūnou. ʻAʻole hiki i ke kiʻi i paʻa ʻia i mua o ke kāmera ke kūnou."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Hoʻopaʻa kī / KWallet Wehe-Aunoa"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"E hoʻā i ka hōʻoia maka i mea e wehe ʻakomi ai i kāu keyring komo a i ʻole "
"KWallet i ke komo ʻana. Mālama palekana kēia i kāu ʻōlelo huna, i hoʻopaʻa "
"ʻia i loko o ka TPM inā loaʻa, a i ʻole i hūnā ʻia me AES-256-GCM me kahi kī "
"nui no root wale nō. Hoʻonohonoho ka hōʻoia maka iā PAM_AUTHTOK no "
"pam_gnome_keyring a i ʻole pam_kwallet5, e like me kāu pākaukau."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Kūlana o kēia manawa:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Ke nānā nei..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "E ho'ā i ka wehe 'akomi"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Kiʻi kī"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "ʻŌlelo hōʻike"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Hahai ka ʻŌlelo Aunoa i ka ʻōlelo ʻōnaehana. Hoʻopili koke ʻia nā loli."

#: src/main.ui:936 src/main.ui:956
msgid "Language"
msgstr "ʻŌlelo"

#: src/main.ui:977
msgid "Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/main.ui:990
msgid "Facial authentication for Linux"
msgstr "Hōʻoiaʻiʻo maka no Linux"

#: src/main.ui:999
msgid "Version unknown"
msgstr "ʻAʻole ʻike ʻia ka mana"

#: src/main.ui:1013
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link</a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Wehe i ka loulou "
"GitHub</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Hōʻike i kahi "
"pilikia a i ʻole e hōʻike i kahi hiʻohiʻona</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "E pili ana"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Welina mai iā Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Ua pau ka hoʻonohonoho ʻana!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Ua pau mākou! Ubuntu Hello i kēia manawa ma kēia kamepiula. E hoʻāʻo e hana "
"i kekahi mea āu e pono ai e paʻi i kāu ʻōlelo huna no ka hōʻoia ʻana, e like "
"me ka holo ʻana i kahi kauoha me sudo. Inā hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻā i ka wehe "
"ʻana i ke kī kī, e wehe ʻokoʻa ʻia kāu kī kī a i ʻole KWallet ma ke komo "
"ʻana.\n"
"\n"
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke wehe i ka Ubuntu Hello Configurator ma hope aku e hoʻololi i "
"nā hoʻonohonoho holomua a i ʻole e hoʻohui i nā hiʻohiʻona hou. E kaomi i ka "
"Finish ma lalo e pani i kēia puka aniani a wehe i ka Ubuntu Hello "
"Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Hoʻonohonoho i kahi kulekele paʻa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Ma muli o ka hoʻololi ʻana i nā kihi, ka mamao, a me nā mea ʻē aʻe, ʻaʻole i "
"like ka hoʻohālikelike ʻana i ke alo me ke kumu hoʻohālike i mālama ʻia. Ma "
"kēia ʻaoʻao hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻonohonoho i ke koʻikoʻi o Ubuntu Hello pono."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"ʻO ke kūlike ʻoluʻolu loa a ʻo ka wikiwiki loa hoʻi e komo ai ʻoe. E koho i "
"kēia inā ʻoi aku ka waiwai o ka maʻalahi ma mua o ka paʻakikī."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"He kūlike paʻakikī, akā wikiwiki nō ke komo ʻana. ʻAʻole paha e ʻike ʻia ʻoe "
"ma ke kihi ʻoi a i ʻole mai kahi mamao aku."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr "ʻO ke kūlike paʻakikī loa, ʻaʻohe hana hou ke komo ʻoe. Paipai ʻia."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Holo i kēia manawa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā ʻoe ke hoʻohui i nā hiʻohiʻona helehelena hou aʻe ma hope mai "
"Settings a i ʻole: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Ke hoʻonohonoho nei i ka webcam"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Ke kukuna nei ka infrared emitter?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"E nānā i ka pahupaʻikiʻi āu i koho ai: hōʻike ka pahupaʻikiʻi infrared i "
"kahi kukui liʻiliʻi e ʻā ana i ka wā e hoʻāʻo ai ʻo Ubuntu Hello iā ia. "
"Hōʻike kēia iā mākou inā hiki iā ia ke ʻike i kou helehelena i ka pōʻeleʻele."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "ʻAe, ʻālohilohi"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "ʻAʻole, ʻaʻohe mea uila"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello e ʻimi maʻalahi i kāu ʻōnaehana no nā pahupaʻikiʻi i loaʻa, no "
"laila e hoʻopaʻa pono i ka pili ʻana o kāu webcam. Ma hope o ka ʻike ʻana e "
"hōʻike ʻia kahi papa inoa o nā webcams hoʻohana. E koho i ka mea āu e "
"makemake ai e hoʻohana a kaomi Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Ke hoʻāʻo nei i kāu webcams, e ʻoluʻolu e kali..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Hoʻoiho ʻana i nā faila ʻikepili"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Pono ʻo Ubuntu Hello i ʻekolu mau ʻikepili ʻike maka i hoʻomaʻamaʻa mua ʻia "
"i hiki ke ʻike iā ʻoe, e hoʻoiho ʻia i kēia manawa. Hiki iā ʻoe ke ʻike i ka "
"holomua download ma lalo nei."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Ke hoʻomaka nei e hoʻoiho..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Welina mai iā Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Manao"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Na kēia wizard e alakaʻi iā ʻoe ma ke kaʻina hana hoʻonohonoho a "
"hoʻonohonoho aunoa iā Ubuntu Hello nou. E kaomi aʻe e hoʻomau."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Hiki iā Ubuntu Hello ke wehe ʻokoʻa i kāu kī hoʻopaʻa inoa a i ʻole KWallet "
"me ka hoʻohana ʻana i ka hōʻoia maka, e pale ana i ka ʻōlelo huna ma hope o "
"ke komo ʻana."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "E hoʻā i ke kī ʻakomi/KWallet wehe"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Hōʻoia i ka ʻŌlelo Huna"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Ke kua"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Hoʻopau i ka hoʻonohonoho"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Aʻe"

